    "content": "<style class=\"gs-marquee-css\">\n/* Static fact ribbon. The auto-scrolling marquee was removed with the rest of the page's\n   animation; the same verified facts now sit in a centred wrapping row that needs no motion\n   and no duplicated track. Copy is verified only: 297 (meals API), the ration range and the\n   ISO/Halal + own-Almaty-production claims Olive publishes. «Доставка каждый день» was\n   dropped at the user's request; the delivery promise now lives in the hero tagline. */\n.gs-marquee{background:var(--gs7-green,#3F6B39);color:#fff;padding:18px 20px}\n.gs-marquee__row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px 20px;\n  max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto}\n.gs-marquee__row span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\n  font:800 1rem/1.3 var(--gs-display,system-ui,sans-serif);letter-spacing:-.02em}\n.gs-marquee__row span::before{content:\"\\2733\";color:var(--gs7-gold,#E0A73C);font-size:12px}\n</style>\n<div class=\"gs-marquee\"><div class=\"gs-marquee__row\">\n  <span>297 блюд</span><span>1 200–2 500 ккал</span><span>Без консервантов</span><span>ISO 22000 и Халал</span><span>Готовим в Алматы</span>\n</div></div>"
  }
}